## Interface: 16001
## Title: TwizHeal
## Notes: One hotkey heals whoever needs it most - tanks first, then healers, then damage - with the right-sized rank of your heal. Party health bars show who TwizHeal picks; in combat, hover a bar and press the hotkey (or click the bar).
